<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Laboratorio Narrativo — Yakuza: Like a Dragon (Capítulo 1)</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-dark: #0f1117;
      --card-bg: #1a1d26;
      --card-border: #2a2f3d;
      --crimson: #d32f2f;
      --crimson-hover: #b71c1c;
      --gold: #ffb300;
      --text-main: #f0f2f5;
      --text-muted: #9aa0a6;
      --code-bg: #232733;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg-dark);
      color: var(--text-main);
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    header {
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--crimson);
      padding-bottom: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    header h1 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      color: #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    header h1 span {
      background: var(--crimson);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--gold);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-left: 15px;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .btn {
      background: var(--crimson);
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      border-radius: 5px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: background 0.2s;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .btn:hover { background: var(--crimson-hover); }
    .badge {
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: #333;
    }
    .badge-gold { background: #5c4300; color: #ffd54f; }
    .badge-red { background: #5c1414; color: #ff8a80; }
    .badge-green { background: #13391b; color: #a5d6a7; }
    footer {
      margin-top: 40px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border);
      padding-top: 15px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h1>
        龍が如く7 <span>Capítulos 1, 2, 3 y 4 (1977 - 2019)</span>
      </h1>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="/">Dashboard</a>
        <a href="/docs/01/briefing">Docs</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <%= yield %>

    <footer>
      Laboratorio Narrativo Yakuza: Like a Dragon — Simulación determinista ejecutándose en Sinatra (puerto 4567).
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
